[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17341.67, "timestamp": "04:49:01", "text": "伙计们，别摔倒了。我只是说说而已。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17345.31, "timestamp": "04:49:05", "text": "我没事。谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17360.948, "timestamp": "04:49:20", "text": "不，你们并没有治好我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17363.23, "timestamp": "04:49:23", "text": "为什么我的治疗师们突然就……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17366.55, "timestamp": "04:49:26", "text": "没错，是时候了。你得走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17373.75, "timestamp": "04:49:33", "text": "正在搜索。我该去哪里？我该去哪里？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17377.35, "timestamp": "04:49:37", "text": "有三个吗？快点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17379.03, "timestamp": "04:49:39", "text": "她市政厅。你看到了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17381.32, "timestamp": "04:49:41", "text": "特点？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17384.39, "timestamp": "04:49:44", "text": "[音乐]"}]